# End-of-Task Workflow
- At task completion, provide a brief closing report:
  - work summary
  - validation status
  - git change state (`staged`, `unstaged`, `untracked`)
  - recommended commit message

# Commit Message Policy
- Use Conventional Commit type in English.
- Write commit description in Korean.
- Title format: `<type>: <한국어 설명>`
- Body should explain "why" in 1-3 short lines when needed.

# Safety Rules
- Do not include secrets or credentials in commit candidates.
- Exclude `.env*` and token/key credential files by default.
